OL,3,AHealey promises reduction in welfare
OL,4,Abill before next election
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Healey has pledged there will be a
OL,7,F"reduction in the benefits bill" before
OL,8,Fthe next general election, after
OL,9,Fopponents criticised his first Budget
OL,10,Ffor lacking details on welfare reform.
OL,12,FThe chancellor told the BBC it is
OL,13,F"simply not good for Britain or
OL,14,Fprogressive to have a bigger and bigger
OL,15,Fbenefits bill", labelling the current
OL,16,Fsystem "unsustainable".
OL,18,FHe ruled out "crude cuts" but more
OL,19,Fdetails on his approach are not
OL,20,Fexpected until two major reviews are
OL,21,Fpublished next month.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/37
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
