OL,3,AHealey promises reduction in welfare
OL,4,Abill before next election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives accused Labour of
OL,7,Fbeing "addicted to welfare", while
OL,8,FReform UK said the Budget did not
OL,9,Faddress the "ballooning" benefits bill.
OL,10,FWelfare spending is forecast to rise
OL,11,Fthis year by #19bn to #353bn.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/37
